#: src/config/watchednicknames_configui.ui:24
msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"<p>\n"
"When the nickname watcher is turned on, you will be notified when the nicknames appearing in the <b>Watched Networks/Nicknames</b> list come online or go offline.</p>"
"\n"
"<p>You can also open the <b>Nicks Online</b> window to see the status of all the watched nicknames.</p>"
"\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Is dat Beluern vun Ökelnaams anmaakt, kriggst Du en Bescheed, wenn de in <b>Beluert Nettwarken/Ökelnaams</b> fastleggt Brukers sik to- oder afkoppelt.</p>"
"\n"
"<p>Du kannst ok dat Finster <b>Tokoppelt Ökelnaams</b> opmaken, wenn Du de Statussen vun all beluert Brukers ankieken wullt.</p>"
"\n"
"</qt>"

