#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KLineEdit, m_realNameEdit)
#. +> trunk
#: src/identitydialog.ui:197
msgid "Enter your real name here. IRC is not intended to keep you hidden from your friends or enemies. Keep this in mind if you are tempted to behave maliciously. A fake \"real name\" can be a good way to mask your gender from all the nerds out there, but the PC you use can always be traced so you will never be truly anonymous."
msgstr "Giff hier Dien rejellen Naam in. Klöönsnacks sünd nich för't Versteken vör Fründ oder Feend maakt. Denk dor an, wenn Du Scherereen maken wullt. Mit en utfunnen \"rejell\" Naam kannst Du twaars Dien Geslecht verbuschen, man Dien Reekner lett sik jümmers opdecken. Dat heet: Du büst nienich redig anonüm."

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KEditListBox, m_nicknameLBox)
#. +> trunk
#: src/identitydialog.ui:208
msgid ""
"This is your list of nicknames. A nickname is the name that other users will know you by. You may use any name you desire. The first character must be a letter.\n"
"\n"
"Since nicknames must be unique across an entire IRC network, your desired name may be rejected by the server because someone else is already using that nickname. Enter alternate nicknames for yourself. If your first choice is rejected by the server, Konversation will try the alternate nicknames."
msgstr ""
"Dit is Dien Ökelnaamlist. En Ökelnaam is de Naam, mit den Du bi anner Brukers begäng büst. Du kannst Di jichtenseen Naam utsöken, man dat eerste Teken mutt en Bookstaav wesen.\n"
"\n"
"Wiel Ökelnaams in't Klöönsnack-Nettwark eenkennig wesen mööt, kann dat wesen, dat De Server Dien Ökelnaam afwiest, wiel de villicht al in Bruuk is. Giff hier noch en poor Utwiek-Ökelnaams in: Wenn de Server den eersten Ökelnaam afwiest, probeert Konversation de nakamen Ökelnaams ut."

