"<p>A channel operator is a user that has special privileges, such as the ability to kick and ban users, change the channel modes, make other users operators</p>"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>"
"<p>Dit wiest de Tall vun Brukers un Klöönruumbasen (OPs) binnen den Klöönruum.</p>"
"<p>En Klöönruumbaas is en Bruker mit besünner Verlöven. He kann a.B. anner Brukers rutsmieten oder utsluten, den Klöönruumbedrief ännern oder anner Brukers to Klöönruumbasen maken.</p>"
"</qt>"

